# CLAUDE.md — Chrome extensions workspace

Extensions managed by tabmill. Tool code (CLI, packages, templates, CI, skill sources) lives
in the tabmill repo — never edit it from here, and never edit `.claude/skills/` (installed
copies; change `tabmill/skills/` and run `tabmill skills sync`).

## Rules

- `extensions/<slug>/extension.yaml` is the source of truth; never hand-edit generated manifests.
- Node only in the builder container: `make in-docker-<target>` or `make buildsh`. Never on the host.
- Publishing never runs unattended: stop at "zip built + checks passing + listing drafted"
  and add `HUMAN: publish <slug>` to TODO.md.
- Directories at the top level that aren't `extensions/` predate tabmill — leave them alone.

